# The three <link> tags that name the icon, as HTML, for what nginx or a Nix build writes into a
# page (favicon.nix, figures-site/default.nix). The Gleam pages, the notes layout, the Hermes docs
# page and the metrics page write the same three links in their own markup.
''<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="48x48"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">''
